Package: briscas
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Dr. Eric Oliver Flores Toro <eoftoro@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt5, python3-pyqt5.qtmultimedia
Section: games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/drericflores/briscas
Description: Classic Briscas card game against a computer opponent
 Briscas provides a desktop implementation of the traditional Spanish
 trick-taking card game, with three computer difficulty levels, sound,
 persistent statistics, and a graphical PyQt5 interface.
